earch observatory with weekly semester public viewing when conditions permit.","evidence_claim":"Keeble Observatory is used for student and faculty research and is open weekly during the semester for weather-dependent public viewing.","source_url":"https://www.rmc.edu/about-rmc/offices-departments/physics-engineering-and-astrophysics/keeble-observatory/","source_title":"Keeble Observatory - Randolph-Macon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"No RSVP is required for weekly public viewing, but confirm weather conditions first; group visits require scheduling.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rmc-blackwell-auditorium","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Blackwell Auditorium","title":"Blackwell Auditorium","subtitle":"Center for the Performing Arts","notes":"Look for a performance or campus arts event, and use the venue as a starting point for following RMC music and theatre programming.","short_summary":"A renovated 630-seat auditorium that has hosted RMC performances since the 1950s.","evidence_claim":"Blackwell Auditorium is part of the Center for the Performing Arts, seats 630, and has hosted RMC performances since the 1950s.","source_url":"https://www.rmc.edu/academics/degrees-and-programs/music/","source_title":"Music - Randolph-Macon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event access and ticketing vary; consult the college calendar or event organizer.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rmc-brown-fountain-plaza","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Brown Fountain Plaza","title":"Brown Fountain Plaza","subtitle":"Central campus gathering space","notes":"Use the plaza as a campus meet-up point or pause between commitments; check the event calendar wh